{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/8986e953598e9c08c57348e730a51c48.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Patch is a 2D side-scrolling detective RPG all about solving a wacky mystery and fighting all sorts of bizarre weirdos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/f4ee304b72f7f87f6efa4d2d88873434.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a cold and subdued night, a stranger in the dark steals the mayor\u2019s precious ruby, a mystical gem that holds immense power, and could possibly lead to the <strong>destruction of the world!</strong> Will Detective Patch (with the help of some odd allies) be able to find whodunit and recover the ruby before it\u2019s too late?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/07939d686fef43aa5263f3e7b2caa6e8.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a stroll through Hazelnut Plaza, a place filled with all sorts of cool stuff to see and do! You can try to stay focused and solve the case as fast as you can, or relax and take the adventure at your own pace. <strong>The plaza can slightly change throughout the day depending on certain actions you take, so stay alert!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/d859472fa992373081d7f0241ccb7a32.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with traditional turn-based combat, or use the unique <strong>interrogation system</strong> to deal with enemies without causing any harm. Doing so will provide you with more clues and extra goodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/9cb893c5414ee33596654b29cb22a303.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and trusty clue book to solve any puzzle that stands in your way! But what does it all mean? I don't know, buy the game to find out or something. (I'm no psychic...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/93207b59085800b6d7f45dd0b15ed05e.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=255 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different areas in the plaza\u00a0that you can explore to your heart's content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 big dungeons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-6 hours of gameplay (For normal playthroughs) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockable costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fun minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and unique battle system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >funny characters and dialogue\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Loads</i> of fun boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 suspects with varying personalities\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A somewhat lighthearted story with a sprinkle of depth </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Bosses?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good time... hopefully :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/38153cf18fddd3856ddeaf65b44a494b.avif?t=1761260392\" width=625 height=500 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2410100?t=1761260392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761260392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761260392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761260392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/8986e953598e9c08c57348e730a51c48.avif?t=1761260392\" width=616 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Patch is a 2D side-scrolling detective RPG all about solving a wacky mystery and fighting all sorts of bizarre weirdos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410100/extras/f4ee304b72f7f87f6efa4d2d88873434.avif?t